Package: ai-gateway-matrix
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: AI Gateway Matrix maintainers <noreply@localhost>
Depends: bash (>= 4.0), coreutils, docker.io | docker-ce, openssl | python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-webkit2-4.1 | gir1.2-webkit2-4.0, minisign, age, jq
Recommends: docker-compose-v2 | docker-compose-plugin
Suggests: python3-yaml
Homepage: https://github.com/dell121212/Private-API
Description: Multi-provider OpenAI-compatible AI gateway (LiteLLM)
 AI Gateway Matrix unifies free/trial LLM APIs behind one OpenAI-compatible
 endpoint with smart routing, a local Chinese dashboard, Redis usage
 tracking and Docker-based deployment.
 .
 System code is installed under /usr/share/ai-gateway-matrix.
 All user data (API keys, config.yaml, state, Redis/Postgres files) lives
 in a single portable directory:
   ${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOME/.config}/ai-gateway-matrix
 Override with AI_GATEWAY_HOME. Copy that directory to migrate machines.
